node src/cli.ts propose werk-contract-facts --ops '[
{"tag":"elaborated","old":"- A basis exists: a depends_on target or a refines parent that is decided and not stale, or `--no-basis` states that none applies. While the basis is open or stale, the card waits (#map-wait). A decided parent is a basis for its child, so a child never needs a depends_on link to its parent.","new":"- A basis exists: a depends_on target or a refines parent that is decided and not stale, or a record states that none applies. While the basis is open or stale, the card waits (#map-wait). A decided parent is a basis for its child, so a child never needs a depends_on link to its parent."},
{"tag":"elaborated","old":"- When `who` is you, an alternative_to option node exists, or `--unchallenged` states that none was weighed. A `me` or `prototype` card needs neither.","new":"- When `who` is you, an alternative_to option node exists, or a record states that none was weighed. A `me` or `prototype` card needs neither."},
{"tag":"elaborated","old":"- A kill criterion is on record (#kill-ask). `werk kill` records one. A criterion of the form no-metric or revisit states that no metric applies (#kill-shape).","new":"- A kill criterion is on record (#kill-ask). A criterion of the form no-metric or revisit states that no metric applies (#kill-shape)."},
{"tag":"elaborated","old":"`edit` accepts `--who`, `--no-basis`, and `--unchallenged`, and `werk kill` adds a criterion. A card fixes a missing fact without being created again.","new":"A card fixes a missing fact without being created again. The commands that run the check and record each fact are #werk-cli-decide and #werk-cli-edit."}
]' 2>&1 | tail -15
